OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does the new Brexit deal mean
OL,4,Afor Northern Ireland?                  
OL,6,FA new deal between the UK and the EU on
OL,7,Ffood, plants and animals will "make a  
OL,8,Freal positive difference for consumers,
OL,9,Fbusinesses and farmers" in Northern    
OL,10,FIreland Stormont's agriculture minister
OL,11,Fhas said.                              
OL,13,FThe agreement was confirmed on Friday  
OL,14,Fafternoon when Prime Minister Andy     
OL,15,FBurnham met European Commission        
OL,16,FPresident Ursula von der Leyen in      
OL,17,FBrussels.                              
OL,19,FSince Brexit, Northern Ireland has     
OL,20,Fcontinued to follow EU rules for       
OL,21,Fagri-food products while the rest of   
OL,22,Fthe UK has not.                        
