OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does the new Brexit deal mean
OL,4,Afor Northern Ireland?                  
OL,6,FThe new deal will see the whole UK     
OL,7,Frealigning with EU rules on those      
OL,8,Fproducts, meaning goods being sent from
OL,9,FGB to NI will no longer need to be     
OL,10,Fchecked at ports.                      
